 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
 
+### User transfer
+
+- The caller must belong to the org in the path (otherwise 404) and be an org admin of it (otherwise 403).
+- The user must belong to the path org → 404.
+- `toOrgId` must name an existing org other than the path org → 400.
+- A user who is a member of an archived project cannot be moved → 409.
+- On success the user moves to the target org and loses org admin. Their memberships in
+  the old org's projects are removed, and tasks they were assigned there become unassigned.
+
